          "name": "Failed Pathname",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Failed Due To Missing Hash",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Callback that is called if the asynchronous SHA verification fails\nThis will be called from a pooled thread.\nNOTE: Each platform is expected to implement this!\n@param FailedPathname Pathname of file that failed to verify\n@param bFailedDueToMissingHash true if the reason for the failure was that the hash was missing, and that was set as being an error condition"
    },
